11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Tunnel Rats (also known as 1968 Tunnel Rats) is a 2008 war
suspense film written and directed by Uwe Boll.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
The film is based on the factual duties of tunnel rats during the Vietnam War.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
In a documentary for the film, Boll revealed the film did not have a
script, and instead the actors improvised their lines.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The box office return was poor but Tunnel Rats was met with positive reviews.

